            "description_html": "<b> 4\" x 16\" Brushed Stainless Steel Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size door push plates primarily used in restaurants, warehouses and stores, but are popular in homes as well. The Push Plate is 4\" wide and 16\" long. Made of .050\" thick high quality solid stainless steel for longevity. It is made out of stainless steel with a brushed stainless steel finish. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PP4016-Specifications.gif?v=1704354726\" width=\"465\" height=\"169\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Brushed Stainless Steel 4\" x 16\" Door Pull Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/4-x-16-stainless-steel-door-pull-plate\"><b>Stainless Steel 4\" x 16\" Pull Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of 4\" x 16\" Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PP4016U32D.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PP4016U32D Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
